# The dapr4s commit the Mill plugin mill-dapr4s-wasm (build.mill's header) and the dapr4s wasm artifacts come from,
# until they are released: a commit of dapr4s PR #47 (https://github.com/sideeffffect/dapr4s/pull/47, branch
# build/mill-upstream-snapshot: dapr4s on the unreleased Mill + mill-scalablytyped that its
# scripts/upstream-snapshot.sh installs; this repository's .mill-version uses the same Mill). wasm/scripts/publish-dapr4s-wasm.sh publishLocal's them from it, at the version build.mill's header
# pins (dapr4s derives it from git: <last tag>+<commits since>-<sha8>-SNAPSHOT), so the classpath is "Central dapr4s
# + the local wasm artifacts":
#   - dapr4s itself: com.github.sideeffffect::dapr4s_sjs1_3:$DAPR4S_CORE_RELEASE from Maven Central (Scala.js IR,
#     linked into the component by the scala-wasm linker);
#   - local: mill-dapr4s-wasm (the build logic), dapr4s-wasm (the adapters), dapr4s-wasm-glue(-exports) (2.13 WIT
#     glue), dapr4s-wasm-scalalib-overlay and dapr4s-wasm-linker.
# Once released, this file goes away: the header pins a Maven Central release and CI stops building dapr4s.
# Read by wasm/scripts/publish-dapr4s-wasm.sh and CI (.github/workflows/e2e.yml, .github/actions/dapr4s-mill-plugin).
DAPR4S_COMMIT=ec5ad2a1557865e289926ab1ff16fd039a18fbe1
DAPR4S_CORE_RELEASE=3.0.0
